<title>USA: Roche gets US OK on sedative for infants.</title>
<headline>Roche gets US OK on sedative for infants.</headline>
<dateline>NUTLEY, N.J. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoffman-La Roche, a unit of Roche Holdings Ltd, said Wednesday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration had cleared its medication Versed for infants in a critical care setting.</p>
<p>The company said the drug can be used to sedate children who must undergo painful medical procedures.</p>
<p>Versed was previously approved for adults and older children.</p>
</text>
